### Generate a treatment-plan-aligned draft note
POST http://localhost:3000/api/amavi-assist/generate-note-draft
x-actor-id: staff_123
x-actor-role: CLINICIAN
x-facility-id: facility_123
x-request-id: req_20260519_001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": "resident_123",
  "facilityId": "facility_123",
  "treatmentPlanId": "tplan_123",
  "problemId": "problem_123",
  "goalId": "goal_123",
  "objectiveId": "objective_123",
  "serviceType": "Individual Therapy",
  "sessionTopic": "Coping skills for anxiety triggers",
  "staffId": "staff_123",
  "treatmentCalendarSessionId": "calendar_session_123",
  "clinicalIntervention": "Reviewed the scheduled coping-skills objective and prompted resident to identify supports listed in the treatment plan.",
  "nextStep": "Continue addressing the objective during the next scheduled individual therapy session."
}

