### Fetch monthly treatment calendar sessions for a resident
GET http://localhost:3000/api/amavi-assist/calendar/resident_123
x-actor-id: staff_123
x-actor-role: CLINICIAN
x-facility-id: facility_123
x-request-id: req_20260519_003

### Fetch draft generation history for a resident
GET http://localhost:3000/api/amavi-assist/generation-history/resident_123
x-actor-id: staff_123
x-actor-role: CLINICIAN
x-facility-id: facility_123
x-request-id: req_20260519_004

### Fetch facility print settings
GET http://localhost:3000/api/amavi-assist/print-settings
x-actor-id: admin_123
x-actor-role: ADMIN
x-facility-id: facility_123
x-request-id: req_20260519_005

### Update facility print settings
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/amavi-assist/print-settings
x-actor-id: admin_123
x-actor-role: ADMIN
x-facility-id: facility_123
x-request-id: req_20260519_006
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityLegalName": "Amavi Behavioral Health LLC",
  "dbaName": "Amavi Recovery Center",
  "address": "123 Care Way, Phoenix, AZ 85001",
  "phone": "602-555-0199",
  "licenseNumber": "BH-123456",
  "logoUrl": "https://example.com/amavi-logo.png",
  "footerDisclaimer": "Printed draft documentation is for internal clinical review until signed by an authorized clinician.",
  "printedNoteTitle": "Therapy Note Draft",
  "showAiDraftDisclaimerOnPrintedDrafts": true,
  "showStaffCredentials": true,
  "showTreatmentPlanLinkageSection": true,
  "showAuditMetadataSection": true
}

### Fetch generated draft print output
GET http://localhost:3000/api/amavi-assist/generated-note-drafts/generation_123/print
x-actor-id: staff_123
x-actor-role: CLINICIAN
x-facility-id: facility_123
x-request-id: req_20260519_007
